      "page_date": "2026-06-25",
      "note": "2026 return brackets for federal tax and every province except Quebec. British Columbia's first rate on this page is 5.6%. Payroll uses 6.14% in the second half of 2026 as a catch-up. Manitoba's return brackets are $47,564 and $101,200. Payroll tables use $47,000 and $100,000."
