      "url": "https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/cpp/contributions.html",
      "note": "2026 ceiling $74,600, additional ceiling $85,000, employee maximum $4,230.45 on the first ceiling, and a 4.00% second contribution with a $416 maximum. The employee rate on the first ceiling is 5.95% (11.9% split with the employer). One sentence on that page still says the 4.00% rate is for 2025. The $416 maximum matches the 2026 band."
